                    <h2 class="fw-500">YOUR PRIVACY RIGHTS AND CHOICES</h2>
                    <p>5.1. Rights under GDPR: The following rights (which may be subject to certain exemptions or derogations), shall apply to certain individuals (some of which only apply to individuals protected by the GDPR):</p>
